WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.633
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, B

00:00:04.141 --> 00:00:11.704
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The theory test is very difficult…I can practise online but I can’t answer the questions.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.277
Can you park on a yellow line?

00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:16.004
I don’t know.

00:00:19.078 --> 00:00:20.868
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, C

00:00:22.232 --> 00:00:24.983
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> A pass in the theory – fantastic!...

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:29.495
My first lesson with dad...total disaster!

00:00:29.771 --> 00:00:33.060
Now dad says I can’t practise in his car.

00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:37.799
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, A

00:00:39.387 --> 00:00:43.861
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I need some practical lessons with a good driving instructor!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.005
Friends, can you…help.